{"answer":null,"concept_id":"arithmetic-intensity-bytes-not-elements","content_sha256":"sha256:58ac76be4e9707b461783f721a006c3c0cb30426afba9c1aa6a416ab58562255","correct_option_ids":["a"],"created_at":1789366773.758181,"domain":"operator-development","explanation":"已有强度填空。补单位与重复读。","id":"q-operator-perf-model-ai-units-001","options":[{"id":"a","text":"按字节（还要计 dtype）；同一权重两次从 HBM 读就算两次，除非第二次命中 L2 且你有测量。用元素个数会在 FP8/BF16 之间不可比。强度是测出来的流量，不是理论最少流量"},{"id":"b","text":"按元素个数，与 dtype 无关"},{"id":"c","text":"权重只算一次，无论读几遍"},{"id":"d","text":"分母应使用峰值带宽而不是实测流量"}],"prompt":"算算术强度时，分母的\"内存流量\"应按元素个数还是字节？权重被两次核读算几次？","schema_version":"question/v1","skill":"calculate","source_refs":[{"kind":"official_docs","title":"NVIDIA Nsight Compute","url":"https://docs.nvidia.com/nsight-compute/NsightCompute/index.html"}],"status":"enabled","topic":"performance-model","type":"single_choice","wiki_refs":[]}
